ning, biking, and cross-country skiing.","source_url":"https://www.ci.athens.oh.us/578/East-State-Street-Park","source_title":"East State Street Park | City of Athens","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Access the bikeway from East State Street Park; bring your own bicycle if riding and use awareness around other trail users.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"west-state-street-park-pickup-games","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"West State Street Park","title":"Set up a pickup game at West State Street Park","subtitle":"West State Street Park, Athens","notes":"Bring a ball or disc, confirm the field is not reserved, and keep the plan flexible for shared use of the open green space.","short_summary":"City fields and green space for informal outdoor play.","evidence_claim":"The City of Athens says West State Street Park fields are available to the public for pickup games when they are not reserved.","source_url":"https://www.ci.athens.oh.us/807/Sports-Fields-and-Greenspaces","source_title":"Sports Fields and Greenspaces | City of Athens","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Fields are available for public pickup games when not reserved; organized play requires a reservation.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"athens-riparian-area-disc-golf","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Athens Community Center Riparian Area Disc Golf Course","title":"Walk the Riparian Area disc golf course","subtitle":"Behind Athens Community Center, beside the bikeway","notes":"Bring a disc if you want to play, or simply walk the course and river corridor while giving players and restoration work plenty of space.","short_summary":"An 18-hole disc golf course in a city-managed river corridor.","evidence_claim":"The City of Athens states that volunteers installed an 18-hole disc golf course in the Riparian Area behind the Athens Community Center.","source_url":"https://www.ci.athens.oh.us/807/Sports-Fields-and-Greenspaces","source_title":"Sports Fields and Greenspaces | City of Athens","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Bring your own disc to play; the Riparian Area is actively managed for habitat restoration, so stay on appropriate paths.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
